# Moddy Arena: a whole battle, won the way a player wins it. In prep he makes a sword with the Apprentice and a stone well in
# the arena; he presses the start button beside the gate, walks in, and beats all five waves (the default table in the
# arena's rules file: husks first, then pillagers, a witch and vindicators) with his sword. The battle is won and the
# arena is put back as built: no mobs, no drops, and the well he made in prep gone.
# A resistance effect keeps him on his feet (setup: a safety guard); every monster is beaten by his own hits: @fight
# turns him to the nearest, walks him up to it and swings at full charge, never walking off the arena's floor (-15..15:
# the default 31-block arena of the rules file). Each wave spawns in the same spots in every run, for the same place
# he stands (play.props arena.spawn.seed).
# Needs a Gate C carrier with @fight (jivinstev/mc-mod-version-upgrade, the @fight pull request); until a carrier
# release has it, build one from that branch and pass its folder as CARRIER_DIR (tools/play.sh).
# play-timeout: 1500
@intent a player presses the start button, beats five waves with a sword he made, wins, and the arena is tidied afterwards
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
# a fresh world's difficulty may be anything but Peaceful's; make sure (each command must change something)
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1500 0 true

@step a sword from the Apprentice, made in the prep room
moddy apprentice a fire sword
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 3/ within 60s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.2 *

@step a stone well in the arena, made from the prep room
# from the middle of the prep room, facing the arena, a make lands through the gate on the arena's floor
@aim look 180 12
@wait 1s
moddy apprentice a stone well
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 3s
@assert execute unless blocks -4 64 3 4 67 15 -4 200 3 all
@shot well-in-the-arena

@step he presses the start button
# a couple of steps toward the gate, then the stone button beside it
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 8t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 2.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect bossbar Wave 1 of 5 within 5s
@shot countdown

@step wave 1: husks, and he walks in through the gate
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,type=!minecraft:husk]
@aim pos 0.5 64.5 16.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 30t
@key key.hotbar.3
@expect bossbar /Wave 1 of 5: [0-9]+ monsters? left/ within 5s
@shot wave-1
@fight @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] within 150s inside -15 -15 15 15
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 10s

@step wave 2: more husks
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@fight @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] within 150s inside -15 -15 15 15
@expect chat Wave 2 cleared within 10s

@step wave 3: husks and pillagers
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:pillager,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@shot wave-3
@fight @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] within 150s inside -15 -15 15 15
@expect chat Wave 3 cleared within 10s

@step wave 4: husks, pillagers, a witch and a vindicator
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:witch,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:vindicator,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@fight @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] within 150s inside -15 -15 15 15
@expect chat Wave 4 cleared within 10s

@step the last wave, and the win
@expect title Wave 5 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@shot wave-5
@fight @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] within 150s inside -15 -15 15 15
@expect title You won within 10s
@expect chat You won the battle within 5s
@shot won

@step the arena is tidied
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 15s
@wait 1s
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=!minecraft:player,x=-17,y=60,z=-17,dx=34,dy=40,dz=34]
# the arena's inside is empty air again (compared with the empty sky at y 200), the well gone
@assert execute if blocks -15 64 -15 15 67 15 -15 200 -15 all
@assert execute if block 0 63 0 minecraft:smooth_sandstone
@assert execute if block -16 65 0 minecraft:stone_bricks
@expect bossbar Wave gone within 5s
@aim look 180 15
@wait 1s
@shot the-arena-tidy
